{"type":"message","id":"a06ca27d","parentId":"6775375e","timestamp":"2026-02-22T12:10:47.137Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"          现在让我获取项目的具体设计文件。根据项目页面信息，设计文件在LCEDA专业版中："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_24a64164cd084813817fecf8","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"MOSS_550W_Pendant_Project/设计文件链接.txt","content":"LCEDA专业版设计链接：\n================================\n主设计链接：https://pro.lceda.cn/editor#id=8d3247999f904fe4886c62ccde0afb43\n\n导出说明：\n1. 访问上述链接并登录LCEDA账号\n2. 在编辑器中选择\"文件\" → \"导出\"\n3. 选择需要导出的文件格式：\n   - Gerber文件 (.zip) - 用于PCB制造\n   - PDF原理图 - 用于查看电路设计\n   - 图片格式 (PNG/JPG) - 用于参考\n   - STEP文件 - 3D模型（如果可用）\n\n推荐导出文件：\n- PCB_Gerber.zip - PCB制造文件\n- Schematic.pdf - 原理图\n- 3D_Model.step - 3D模型文件\n- BOM.csv - 物料清单\n\n由于浏览器自动化限制，请手动访问上述链接导出文件，然后将文件保存到对应的文件夹中。"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":26987,"output":275,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27262,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771762158164}}
