{"type":"message","id":"b2b1d4ff","parentId":"68632f2f","timestamp":"2026-02-22T12:14:57.863Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                  现在创建英文版本的文件："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_88ad1f601dbf4edfa62ee345","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"MOSS_550W_Pendant_Project_English/Project_Description.txt","content":"Wandering Earth 2 550W/MOSS Pendant - Project Files\n====================================================\n\nProject Information:\n- Name: Wandering Earth 2 550W/MOSS Pendant\n- Platform: OSHWHub (LCEDA Open Source Hardware)\n- Link: https://oshwhub.com/sisst/hellomoss\n- License: CC-BY 3.0\n- Creator: SisST\n- Created: 2023-02-08\n\nProject Description:\nThis is a flat PCB pendant design based on the 550W/MOSS AI from the movie Wandering Earth 2.\nA low-cost DIY alternative to expensive official models.\n\nFile Structure:\n├── PCB_Design/          # PCB design files\n├── Enclosure_Files/     # Enclosure related files  \n├── Documentation/       # Project documentation\n└── Project_Description.txt # This file\n\nAssembly Instructions:\n1. Project contains 7 parts, need to cut along X-marked lines\n2. Requires soldering after cutting\n3. Recommended tools: mini grinder + composite cutting disc\n4. Control soldering temperature to avoid yellowing\n5. No included stand - need to make your own\n\nImportant Notes:\n- For learning and exchange only\n- Do not use for commercial purposes\n- Read instructions carefully before assembly\n- CC-BY 3.0 open source license\n\nFile List:\n(Will be updated after downloading actual design files)"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":31383,"output":355,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":31738,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771762480312}}
