{"type":"message","id":"1fb56b83","parentId":"004fc9f6","timestamp":"2026-02-22T12:15:13.387Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"          "},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_d3fddeeae6be4e76a6af3dd6","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"MOSS_550W_Pendant_Project_English/Design_Links.txt","content":"LCEDA Professional Design Links:\n================================\nMain Design Link: https://pro.lceda.cn/editor#id=8d3247999f904fe4886c62ccde0afb43\n\nExport Instructions:\n1. Visit the above link and login to LCEDA\n2. In the editor, select \"File\" → \"Export\"\n3. Choose required file formats:\n   - Gerber Files (.zip) - For PCB manufacturing\n   - PDF Schematic - For circuit reference\n   - Image formats (PNG/JPG) - For reference\n   - STEP files - 3D models (if available)\n\nRecommended Exports:\n- PCB_Gerber.zip - PCB manufacturing files\n- Schematic.pdf - Circuit schematic\n- 3D_Model.step - 3D model file\n- BOM.csv - Bill of Materials\n\nDue to browser automation limitations, please manually visit the link to export files and save them to corresponding folders."}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":31766,"output":240,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":32006,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771762497878}}
