{"type":"message","id":"07b92225","parentId":"feaebd50","timestamp":"2026-02-22T12:15:28.157Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"          "},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_2de1a36a364a4cdc88b64d87","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"MOSS_550W_Pendant_Project_English/Download_Guide.txt","content":"MOSS Pendant Project File Download Guide\n===========================================\n\nStep 1: Access Design Files\n---------------------------\nOpen browser and visit:\nhttps://pro.lceda.cn/editor#id=8d3247999f904fe4886c62ccde0afb43\n\nStep 2: Login to LCEDA\n---------------------\n- Register if you don't have an account\n- Login to LCEDA Professional edition\n\nStep 3: Export Files\n-------------------\nIn the editor interface:\n1. Click \"File\" in menu bar\n2. Select \"Export\" option\n3. Choose required file formats:\n\nFiles to Export:\n- PCB Files → Gerber format (.zip)\n- Schematic → PDF format\n- 3D Model → STEP format (if available)\n- BOM List → CSV/Excel format\n\nStep 4: Save Files\n-----------------\nSave exported files according to this structure:\n\nPCB_Design/ Folder:\n- MOSS_PCB_Gerber.zip\n- MOSS_Schematic.pdf\n\nEnclosure_Files/ Folder:\n- MOSS_3D_Model.step (if available)\n- MOSS_Enclosure_Drawing.pdf\n\nDocumentation/ Folder:\n- MOSS_BOM.csv (Bill of Materials)\n- Project documentation\n\nStep 5: Manufacturing Preparation\n---------------------------------\n1. Upload Gerber files to PCB manufacturer (e.g., JLCPCB)\n2. Purchase components according to BOM list\n3. Prepare soldering tools and materials\n\nImportant Notes:\n- Project requires cutting and soldering\n- Contains 7 parts, cut along X lines\n- Recommended: mini grinder + composite cutting disc\n- Control soldering temperature"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":32032,"output":410,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":32442,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771762513399}}
