{"type":"message","id":"7906ea22","parentId":"b8d896e4","timestamp":"2026-02-22T12:16:51.099Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"          "},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_c3b35794c05a445c8226fbb0","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"MOSS_550W_Pendant_Project_English/README.md","content":"# Wandering Earth 2 550W/MOSS Pendant Project\n\n## Project Overview\nThis is a flat PCB pendant design project based on the 550W/MOSS AI from the movie \"Wandering Earth 2\". Created and open-sourced by SisST.\n\n## Project Features\n- 🎬 Based on \"Wandering Earth 2\" movie IP\n- 💰 Low-cost DIY alternative\n- 🔧 Requires cutting and soldering\n- 🎨 Flat PCB art design\n- 📏 7-part assembly\n\n## File Structure\n```\nMOSS_550W_Pendant_Project_English/\n├── PCB_Design/           # PCB design files\n│   ├── Gerber_Files.zip # PCB manufacturing files\n│   ├── Schematic.pdf    # Circuit schematic\n│   └── PCB_Design.pro    # LCEDA design files\n├── Enclosure_Files/     # Enclosure related files\n│   ├── 3D_Model.step    # 3D model files\n│   └── Enclosure_Drawing.pdf # Enclosure drawings\n├── Documentation/       # Documentation\n│   ├── BOM_List.csv     # Bill of Materials\n│   ├── Assembly_Guide.pdf # Assembly instructions\n│   └── Soldering_Notes.txt # Soldering instructions\n├── Project_Description.txt # Project basic info\n├── Design_Links.txt     # LCEDA design links\n├── Download_Guide.txt   # File download guide\n├── File_Organizer.bat   # File organization tool\n└── README.md           # This readme file\n```\n\n## Getting Design Files\n\n### Method 1: LCEDA Professional Export\n1. Visit: https://pro.lceda.cn/editor#id=8d3247999f904fe4886c62ccde0afb43\n2. Login to your LCEDA account\n3. Select \"File\" → \"Export\" in menu\n4. Export these file formats:\n   - **Gerber Files** (.zip) - For PCB manufacturing\n   - **PDF Schematic** - Circuit design reference\n   - **STEP Files** - 3D models (if available)\n   - **BOM List** - Component procurement list\n\n### Method 2: Manual Organization\nFollow instructions in \"Download_Guide.txt\" to manually download and organize files.\n\n## Assembly Steps\n\n### 1. PCB Manufacturing\n- Upload Gerber files to PCB manufacturer (e.g., JLCPCB)\n- Choose appropriate board thickness and color\n- Confirm production parameters and order\n\n### 2. Component Procurement\n- Purchase components according to BOM list\n- Pay attention to specifications and quantities\n\n### 3. Cutting and Assembly\n- Use mini grinder + composite cutting disc to cut along X lines\n- Separate the 7 parts\n- Solder assembly according to design\n\n### 4. Soldering Notes\n- Control soldering temperature to avoid PCB yellowing\n- Use appropriate solder and flux\n- Clean solder joints after completion\n\n## Technical Specifications\n- **Design Software**: LCEDA Professional\n- **PCB Layers**: 2 layers\n- **Board Material**: FR-4\n- **Process Requirements**: Precision cutting needed\n- **Assembly Method**: Soldered connections\n\n## Open Source License\nThis project uses **CC-BY 3.0** open source license:\n- ✅ Free to use, modify, distribute\n- ✅ Attribution required\n- ❌ Commercial use prohibited\n\n## Author Information\n- **Creator**: SisST\n- **Platform**: LCEDA Open Source Hardware Platform\n- **Project Link**: https://oshwhub.com/sisst/hellomoss\n- **Creation Date**: 2023-02-08\n\n## Support and Feedback\nFor assembly questions, check comments on the original project page or ask questions there.\n\n---\n*Note: This project is for learning and exchange only, not for commercial use.*"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":32712,"output":880,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":33592,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771762543036}}
